{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.13, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.9 (externs, proposed for Revision 40)"
  description: """
    An extern of a choice that is not disjoint stands at a position of its own. `either_x` reaches
    extern-choices.tn's `( a | b )`, two records, so a value there takes a tag, and the tag is the enclosing
    scope's: `a_x` reaches the variant `a`, and the value is read against it.
    """
  valid: _
